# NEV-AKE

Build from a specific parameter directory.

```sh
cd Implementations/<implementation>/<parameter>
make SPEED
make KAT
```

Implementations:

- `Reference_Implementation`
- `Optimized_Implementation/avx2`

Parameters include `NEV-AKE-C1`, `NEV-AKE-C1-c`, `NEV-AKE-C2`, `NEV-AKE-C2-c`, `NEV-AKE-C3`, `NEV-AKE-C3-c`, `NEV-AKE-R1`, `NEV-AKE-R2`, `NEV-AKE-R3`.

`make SPEED` builds and runs the speed benchmark using the SHA-3 backend.
`make KAT` builds and runs ICCS KAT generation. Generated files are written to `output/`.

```sh
make clean
```



